        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seeing the World Through Each Other's Eyes – I See Me</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Hojin sets out to rescue Mimi, who has beyond the Rainbow Bridge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't a simple rescue story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very special ordeal awaits them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623670/extras/0771e38608f488d5e5da5b587f54f4b3.avif?t=1758800093\" width=909 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Unique Co-op Twist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I See Me is a game where Hojin and Mimi, with your screen shows your partner’s character, and their screen shows yours, travel back beyond the Rainbow Bridge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They must see the world through each other's eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's why cooperation is essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without true teamwork between the two, they can't advance to the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust each other, have the occasional mental breakdown, and overcome obstacles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brain, Voice, and Hands are Fully Operational!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beating a level without communication? Impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Left! No, right! Jump, jump!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your movements through conversation with your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623670/extras/a433c08e74106407299cc8b751ae89f5.avif?t=1758800093\" width=1065 height=714 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Small Glimmer of Hope Amidst Trials: Item.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a special item will briefly restore your vision to normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's only for a brief moment, so stay alert and overcome the difficult sections!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623670/extras/f76f56389e5ac4ed4dc9516a7e5854b1.avif?t=1758800093\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Memory Fragments and Hidden Stories!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you discover &quot;memory fragments&quot; during your adventure,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimi and Hojin's pasts will be revealed, piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aren't you curious about the story behind Hojin and Mimi?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623670/extras/ee5d37523054e35245052dc7bcbe449c.poster.avif?t=1758800093\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623670/extras/ee5d37523054e35245052dc7bcbe449c.webm?t=1758800093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623670/extras/ee5d37523054e35245052dc7bcbe449c.mp4?t=1758800093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, on the Rainbow Bridge, your view keeps swapping—and the path is full of traps and tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, are you ready for the extraordinary adventure of traveling back across the Rainbow Bridge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won’t be easy—but together, you can make it to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hojin and Mimi! Let's work together to create a miracle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because together, there's nothing we can't do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623670/extras/0fb6ab27f78d31b1b7391fe06dac6243.avif?t=1758800093\" width=942 height=444 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seeing the World Through Each Other's Eyes – I See Me</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Hojin sets out to rescue Mimi, who has beyond the Rainbow Bridge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't a simple rescue story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very special ordeal awaits them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623670/extras/0771e38608f488d5e5da5b587f54f4b3.avif?t=1758800093\" width=909 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Unique Co-op Twist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I See Me is a game where Hojin and Mimi, with your screen shows your partner’s character, and their screen shows yours, travel back beyond the Rainbow Bridge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They must see the world through each other's eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's why cooperation is essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without true teamwork between the two, they can't advance to the next stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust each other, have the occasional mental breakdown, and overcome obstacles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brain, Voice, and Hands are Fully Operational!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beating a level without communication? Impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Left! No, right! Jump, jump!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your movements through conversation with your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623670/extras/a433c08e74106407299cc8b751ae89f5.avif?t=1758800093\" width=1065 height=714 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Small Glimmer of Hope Amidst Trials: Item.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a special item will briefly restore your vision to normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's only for a brief moment, so stay alert and overcome the difficult sections!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623670/extras/f76f56389e5ac4ed4dc9516a7e5854b1.avif?t=1758800093\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Memory Fragments and Hidden Stories!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you discover &quot;memory fragments&quot; during your adventure,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimi and Hojin's pasts will be revealed, piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aren't you curious about the story behind Hojin and Mimi?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623670/extras/ee5d37523054e35245052dc7bcbe449c.poster.avif?t=1758800093\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623670/extras/ee5d37523054e35245052dc7bcbe449c.webm?t=1758800093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623670/extras/ee5d37523054e35245052dc7bcbe449c.mp4?t=1758800093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, on the Rainbow Bridge, your view keeps swapping—and the path is full of traps and tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, are you ready for the extraordinary adventure of traveling back across the Rainbow Bridge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won’t be easy—but together, you can make it to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hojin and Mimi! Let's work together to create a miracle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because together, there's nothing we can't do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623670/extras/0fb6ab27f78d31b1b7391fe06dac6243.avif?t=1758800093\" width=942 height=444 /></span></p>",
